Task: Task #1: Warp - Asset Management (openclaw_assets.c)
Prompt: Implement asset loading logic for OpenClaw on Flipper Zero. 1. Define structures for Sprite and Tilemap assets. 2. Implement storage_open/read for loading binary assets from /ext/apps/Games/openclaw/. 3. Ensure memory efficiency: use buffered reads and avoid large heap allocations. 4. Implement a simple cache for frequently used tiles.

